Error [jet.CopyNotSupported]: `Edit` can't be copied
  --> tests/ui/ownership/mutable_view_aggregates_are_not_cloneable.jet:12:16
    |
 12 |     duplicate: borrowed.copy()
    |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Copy needs a value made only of duplicable parts; this type holds something Jet can't duplicate — a function value, a trait value, or a type from outside Jet
 Fix: Move it instead with `.move()` if this is its last use, or change the type so every part can be copied
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0211

Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: `target[…]` already has a live view that conflicts with `duplicate`
  --> tests/ui/ownership/mutable_view_aggregates_are_not_cloneable.jet:12:5
    |
 12 |     duplicate: borrowed.copy()
    |     ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Many read views may overlap, but an exclusive mutable view cannot overlap any other live view
 Fix: Finish using the earlier view before creating this one, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
